{"title":"Career Roadmap · Banking Lawyer","role":"Banking Lawyer","summary":"A Banking Lawyer advises banks, NBFCs, fintech companies, insurance companies, financial institutions, borrowers, investors, and other businesses on financial transactions, regulatory compliance, lending, security creation, recovery, disputes, and financial contracts.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Banking & Insurance Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Banking Lawyer advises banks, NBFCs, fintech companies, insurance companies, financial institutions, borrowers, investors, and other businesses on financial transactions, regulatory compliance, lending, security creation, recovery, disputes, and financial contracts."},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines commercial law","banking regulations","finance","contracts","litigation/dispute resolution."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Work"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Draft and review loan agreements"},{"text":"Review security and collateral documentation"},{"text":"Advise on banking and financial regulations"},{"text":"Handle borrower and lender documentation"},{"text":"Conduct legal due diligence"},{"text":"Work on mortgage, pledge, hypothecation and guarantee documents"},{"text":"Support debt recovery proceedings"},{"text":"Advise on restructuring and stressed assets"},{"text":"Review banking and fintech contracts"},{"text":"Handle financial-sector disputes"},{"text":"Advise on regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Support mergers, acquisitions and financing transactions"},{"text":"Work with RBI-related regulatory requirements and applicable financial-sector laws"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["10+2 / Equivalent","Integrated BA/BBA/B.Com/B.Sc LL.B","Banking & Financial Law Specialisation","Banking / NBFC / Fintech 