text":"Banking Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Loan structures"},{"text":"Borrower and lender relationships"},{"text":"Interest"},{"text":"Default"},{"text":"Guarantees"},{"text":"Security interests"},{"text":"Collateral"},{"text":"Mortgage"},{"text":"Pledge"},{"text":"Hypothecation"},{"text":"Assignment"},{"text":"Corporate guarantees"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Exercise"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a sample corporate loan and identify:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Borrower","Loan Agreement","Security"]},{"type":"p","text":"├── Mortgage"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Hypothecation"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Pledge"},{"type":"flow","items":["└── Guarantee","Repayment","Default / Enforcement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Banking & Financial Law"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the critical specialization stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking Law"},{"text":"Insurance Law"},{"text":"Corporate Finance"},{"text":"Securities Law"},{"text":"Insolvency Law"},{"text":"Competition Law"},{"text":"Commercial Dispute Resolution"},{"text":"Financial regulations"},{"text":"Negotiable instruments"},{"text":"Debt recovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Indian Legal Areas"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reserve Bank of India regulatory framework"},{"text":"Banking Regulation framework"},{"text":"Negotiable Instruments law"},{"text":"Securitisation and enforcement of security interests"},{"text":"Insolvency and Bankruptcy framework"},{"text":"Companies legislation"},{"text":"Consumer protection"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Arbitration"},{"text":"Securities-market regulation"},{"text":"Insurance regulation"},{"text":"Anti-money-laundering requirements"},{"text":"Data/privacy requirements relevant to financial institutions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should always verify the current regulations, rules, circulars and regulatory directions applicable to the particular transaction because financial-sector regulation changes frequently."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Advanced Banking & Finance Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"For a 5-year integrated law program, the later years should become strongly practice-oriented."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking transactions"},{"text":"Project finance"},{"text":"Corporate lending"},{"text":"Structured finance"},{"text":"Debt financing"},{"text":"Acquisition finance"},{"text":"Insolvency & restructuring"},{"text":"Debt recovery"},{"text":"Financial-sector compliance"},{"text":"Fintech regulation"},{"text":"Digital lending"},{"text":"Payment systems"},{"text":"Financial contracts"},{"text":"Banking disputes"},{"text":"Arbitration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Work"},{"type":"p","text":"Students should learn to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Review a loan agreement"},{"text":"Identify legal risks"},{"text":"Prepare a legal opinion"},{"text":"Conduct banking due diligence"},{"text":"Review security documents"},{"text":"Draft legal notices"},{"text":"Analyze regulatory requirements"},{"text":"Prepare transaction checklists"},{"text":"Research banking judgments"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Technical Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Skills to Develop"],"rows":[[{"text":"Banking Law"},{"text":"Banking regulations, lender-borrower relationships"}],[{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Loan agreements, facility agreements, guarantees"}],[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Credit, debt, interest, securities"}],[{"text":"Security Law"},{"text":"Mortgage, pledge, hypothecation, charge"}],[{"text":"Corporate Law"},{"text":"Companies, directors, corporate borrowing"}],[{"text":"Insolvency"},{"text":"CIRP, restructuring, creditor rights"}],[{"text":"Debt Recovery"},{"text":"Recovery proceedings and enforcement"}],[{"text":"Litigation"},{"text":"Banking disputes and commercial litigation"}],[{"text":"Regulatory"},{"text":"RBI and financial-sector compliance"}],[{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Policies, claims, regulatory framework"}],[{"text":"Fintech"},{"text":"Digital lending, payments, technology"}],[{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"Case law, statutes, regulations"}],[{"text":"Contract Drafting"},{"text":"Drafting and reviewing financial documents"}],[{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Lender/borrower negotiation"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Legal databases, document automation, AI tools"}]]}]},{"heading":"Banking Lawyer Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Client Requirement","Understand Transaction","Identify Applicable Laws","Legal & Regulatory Research","Due Diligence","Risk Identification","Contract Drafting / Review","Negotiation","Execution","Compliance Monitoring","Dispute / Default / Restructuring","Legal Resolution"]}]},{"heading":"Banking & Finance Documents to Learn","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong student portfolio should demonstrate familiarity with documents such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Lending Documents"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Loan agreement"},{"text":"Facility agreement"},{"text":"Term loan agreement"},{"text":"Working capital documentation"},{"text":"Sanction letter"},{"text":"Demand promissory note"},{"text":"Letter of undertaking"},{"text":"Guarantee agreement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Security Documents"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mortgage documents"},{"text":"Hypothecation agreement"},{"text":"Pledge agreement"},{"text":"Security agreement"},{"text":"Deed of assignment"},{"text":"Corporate guarantee"},{"text":"Personal guarantee"},{"text":"Charge-related documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Transaction Documents"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal opinion"},{"text":"Due-diligence report"},{"text":"Term sheet"},{"text":"Confidentiality agreement"},{"text":"Inter-creditor agreement"},{"text":"Escrow agreement"},{"text":"Assignment agreement"}]}]},{"heading":"Tools & Digital Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Legal Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SCC Online"},{"text":"Manupatra"},{"text":"Indian Kanoon"},{"text":"Official legislation portals"},{"text":"RBI regulatory publications"},{"text":"Financial-sector regulator publications"},{"text":"Government notifications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Productivity"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"PDF/document comparison tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract lifecycle management"},{"text":"Document automation"},{"text":"Legal research AI"},{"text":"Contract review AI"},{"text":"Due-diligence platforms"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Legal document management"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Banking Loan Agreement Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Review a sample loan agreement and identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Borrower obligations"},{"text":"Lender rights"},{"text":"Events of default"},{"text":"Representations and warranties"},{"text":"Covenants"},{"text":"Security requirements"},{"text":"Termination provisions"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Portfolio Output","text":"5–10 page legal review."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Banking Legal Due Diligence"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical due-diligence report for a company seeking a bank loan."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate documents"},{"text":"Existing loans"},{"text":"Charges"},{"text":"Litigation"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Material contracts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Security Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study and prepare simplified examples of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mortgage"},{"text":"Hypothecation"},{"text":"Pledge"},{"text":"Guarantee"},{"text":"Assignment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Banking Regulation Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a banking/financial-services issue and produce a legal research paper."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital lending regulation"},{"text":"Fintech compliance"},{"text":"Account aggregator ecosystem"},{"text":"Payment-system regulation"},{"text":"Banking fraud"},{"text":"Customer data protection"},{"text":"AI in financial services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Debt Recovery Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a hypothetical case:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Loan Granted","Borrower Default","Demand Notice","Security Enforcement","Recovery Proceedings","Possible Insolvency","Resolution / Recovery"]},{"type":"p","text":"Explain the legal options available to the lender and borrower."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are extremely important for this career."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Small law firms"},{"text":"Legal aid organizations"},{"text":"Corporate legal departments"},{"text":"General commercial-law practices"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on legal research and drafting."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking law firms"},{"text":"Corporate law firms"},{"text":"NBFC legal departments"},{"text":"Bank legal departments"},{"text":"Financial-services companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn contracts and commercial documentation."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking & finance law teams"},{"text":"Corporate law firms"},{"text":"Insolvency practices"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"Fintech companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Work on actual transaction and compliance matters where permitted."},{"typ