,{"text":"Embedded finance"},{"text":"Digital identity"},{"text":"Fraud detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Blockchain & Digital Assets"},{"type":"p","text":"Basic understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Blockchain"},{"text":"Smart contracts"},{"text":"Tokenization"},{"text":"Digital assets"},{"text":"Custody"},{"text":"Financial compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The legal treatment of digital assets varies by jurisdiction and can change rapidly, so students should treat this as an evolving regulatory field."}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Banking Lawyer candidate should graduate with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Banking law"},{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Insolvency"},{"text":"Securities law"},{"text":"Insurance law"},{"text":"Commercial disputes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Credit fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Banking products"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract drafting"},{"text":"Due diligence"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal opinions"},{"text":"Regulatory analysis"},{"text":"Negotiation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fintech"},{"text":"Digital lending"},{"text":"Payments"},{"text":"AI legal tools"},{"text":"Data/privacy fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"At least:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2 banking-law research papers"},{"text":"2 contract-drafting exercises"},{"text":"1 loan-document review"},{"text":"1 banking due-diligence project"},{"text":"1 debt-recovery case study"},{"text":"2 relevant internships"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BANKING LAWYER"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Banking & Financial Law"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Banking Regulation"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Lending"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Security"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Debt Recovery"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Financial Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Corporate Law"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Companies"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Corporate Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Transactions"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Commercial Law"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Contracts"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Negotiation"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Due Diligence"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Dispute Resolution"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Banking Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Arbitration"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Recovery"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Accounting"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Credit"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Financial Markets"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Fintech"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Digital Lending"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Payments"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── LegalTech / AI"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Professional Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Legal Research"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Drafting"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Negotiation"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Commercial Thinking"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this career is:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Commercial lawyer specializing in banking, finance, financial regulation and fintech.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Rather than becoming a lawyer who only knows banking statutes, the student should develop the ability to understand a financial transaction, identify its legal and regulatory risks, draft/review the documentation, negotiate protections, and support the client through execution or dispute."},{"type":"p","text":"That combination of law + finance + regulatory knowledge + fintech + contract skills provides the strongest long-term foundation for a Banking Lawyer career."}]}]}